  {
    "id": 1002005060010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、どうして私を合格にしたんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……んん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしたんだ、突然",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どう、と言われると\r\nどうもしないんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "しいて言うなら、エキシビションがあったからでしょうか\r\n最初の頃を思い出したので",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……\r\nうん、そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "真乃とめぐると、３人でユニットを組むと聞いた時、\r\n同時に『W.I.N.G.』優勝も目指すと聞きました",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから、というわけではないのですが、\r\nアイドルの私の始まりが『W.I.N.G.』というか……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "合格はいただいていましたが、\r\nイルミネになったのは、あの時なので",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "一緒に思い出してしまうんですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずっと気にしてたか？\r\nどうして自分が合格したのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "気にしていた、というほどでは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "聞いてもいいのかなというふうには、少し",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "審査の内容とか、基準とかって\r\n聞いたらまずいのかもしれない、とか",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そういうのも少し考えたりはしました",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "合格して、今こうしてアイドルをやっていますし\r\n過ぎたことを掘り返すのは野暮かな、とか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ただ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200506/1002005060130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002005060140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ずっと引っかかってはいたんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
